    "rating": 3.6,
    "reference": "ChIJt9EWhhdIyUwRnPKid-StoIk",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Donald Joanisse",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108334294454703159535/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLdYOOYLoGRSeCERqeCRFoLmUDmZerZy55MaakxdZwDM-HmBA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I will be going back to club piscine for a third time to get my pool robot fixed.\nI called earlier to inquire what to expect this time around and I was told I’m negative.\nAnd I was told to clean my pool with the brush. Like hell I will, it’s why I bought a pool robot.\nMore info when I return from my third trip\n\nThis is the follow up\n\nI just returned from my 4th trip to the dealer. He claims it’s working so I return home and try it out, it’s not working.\nNow I’m told to go to a repair shop to have it fixed.\nI tried contacting the manufacturer but I’m on permanent hold it seems.\n\nMore to come",
        "time": 1755897928,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jocelyne",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103173371673166510069/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUh0vU0hsz9Dof1tDKGmdBYK0C4M-2l4y_Sal3_i9_7m-wSkHN-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I hired Club Piscine to winterize my hot tub.  They phoned the day before as promised to give me an idea of when the technician would come by the next day.\n\nAlex arrived within that window of time, was very courteous, knowledgeable and efficient.  He got the job done, explained the process as he went and was very polite.\n\nClub Piscine offered the earliest service date and the best price for this service.  Very happy with them overall and would definitely recommend Club Piscine for winterizing a hot tub.  Thank you.",
        "time": 1763509804,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Joseph Yu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102420068154969696787/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKxn0soddq5qPR27cKw7h_41jKNi91YhAw37Ra2zLfmC9pkoA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Bought a new home with a pool and a total pool novice.  All of the staff were knowledgeable and friendly.  The pump switch fried and I had it replaced by their technician on-site.  It was completed within the hour.  All in all im super impressed by their service and competitive pricing on all products in store.  Highly recommend going here for all your pool needs!",
        "time": 1756385998,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mark Novak",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109686089670447638441/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXzKjPns0_AwICoRtAE7lyP-68cjpRU9EBiowXadZC9lhGryPTU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I had an amazing experience at Club Piscine thanks to Shayne. I walked into the store looking to buy a circulation pump for my Jacuzzi and was speaking with the service counter when Shayne happened to walk by. He overheard the conversation, asked what year my spa was, and right away realized it was still under warranty. Instead of letting me spend $600 unnecessarily, he set up an appointment to have the motor replaced for free.\n\nI’m super impressed by how he went out of his way to help me and save me money. Shayne was knowledgeable, professional, and genuinely cared about making sure I got the right solution. Because of service like this, I’ll definitely be returning to Club Piscine for anything I need for my hot tub. It gives you real confidence that you’re getting a fair deal every time you shop there.",
        "time": 1755521598,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Peter Hanna",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107035077654785453371/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV4Vq-2BUgd2C8POUKJAumhKEyMYILbjEyq-g1rrIdqRZWbP4u3=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Helpful and professional staff\nI had problems with my spa (I broke the lever although it’s a new spa less than one year)\nI sent an email\nThey called  me and set an appointment for changing it\n\nThe service and the pieces were  not covered in the warranty.\nThey said the cover is not including in the warranty!!",
        "time": 1709415666,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
